      "body": "## Motivation\n\nA comment in the GLM-5-Next NextN weight mapper is inaccurate and misleads\nreaders. `get_hf_to_sglang_mapper` ends with:\n\n```python\n# target rules still normalize the non-draft layers and vision tower in `exclude`\nreturn Glm5NextForConditionalGeneration.hf_to_sglang_mapper | WeightsMapper(\n    orig_to_new_substr=draft_rules,\n)\n```\n\n`WeightsMapper` has no `exclude` field — it only has `orig_to_new_substr`,\n`orig_to_new_prefix`, and `orig_to_new_suffix`\n(`python/sglang/srt/models/utils.py`). There is no \"exclude\" mechanism involved.\n\n## Modifications\n\nComment-only change in `python/sglang/srt/models/glm5_next_nextn.py`. Replace the\ncomment with an accurate description of what the reused target mapper\n(`Glm5NextForConditionalGeneration.hf_to_sglang_mapper`) actually does\n(`model.language_model.` -> `model.`, `model.visual` -> `visual`,\n`.attn.qkv` -> `.attn.qkv_proj`) and that the draft rules are merged on top. No\ncode behavior change.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nNot applicable — comment-only change, no model output or forward-path change.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable — comment-only change.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the Format code with pre-commit (comment-only; ruff check clean).\n- [ ] Add unit tests according to the Run and add unit tests (not applicable, comment-only).\n- [ ] Update documentation according to Write documentations (not applicable).\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results (not applicable).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style guidance.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38425550401](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38425550401)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38425550360](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38425550360)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38425550372](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38425550372)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
